---
---

<section class="roadmap section reveal" id="roadmap">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="roadmap-header reveal delay-100">
      <div class="badge glow-badge" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <span class="badge-text">Vision 2026</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title">The Universal <span class="accent-text">Identity Fabric.</span></h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">With <strong>v1.0.0 GA</strong> established as the enterprise baseline across 25 regression test suites, GitSetu expands from local workstation security to universal developer, CI/CD, and agentic identity orchestration.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Foundation Baseline Banner -->
    <div class="baseline-banner reveal delay-150">
      <div class="baseline-badge">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
        <span>Shipped in v1.0.0 GA</span>
      </div>
      <p class="baseline-desc">Zero-Trust Pre-Commit Guard • Native Windows PowerShell Installer & Shims • Homebrew & Scoop Formulas • Workspace Auto-Provisioning • Longest-Match Routing • 25 Automated Suites (198 Assertions) • Windows Sandbox Live Harness</p>
    </div>

    <div class="roadmap-grid">
      <!-- Roadmap Item 1 -->
      <div class="roadmap-card reveal delay-200">
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accent-icon"><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"></path><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"></line></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Universal Distribution</h3>
        <p>Single-file standalone bundle (no git clone), Homebrew Tap & Scoop bucket activation, Winget, AUR, Nix Flakes, GitHub CLI extension (<code>gh gitsetu</code>), and 1-second auto-discovery (<code>gitsetu init --auto</code>).</p>
        <span class="status-label">Phase 1</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Roadmap Item 2 -->
      <div class="roadmap-card reveal delay-300">
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accent-icon"><path d="M12 20h9"></path><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Parity & Ecosystem UX</h3>
        <p>Interactive Web Config Visualizer on <code>gitsetu.bhaskarjha.dev</code>, fuzzy profile switching (<code>fzf</code>), native VS Code status-bar guard, and structured JSON API.</p>
        <span class="status-label">Phase 2</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Roadmap Item 3 -->
      <div class="roadmap-card reveal delay-400">
        <div class="roadmap-icon">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accent-icon"><path d="M21.5 2v6h-6M2.5 22v-6h6M2 11.5a10 10 0 0 1 18.8-4.3M22 12.5a10 10 0 0 1-18.8 4.3"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>The Enterprise Moat</h3>
        <p>Scheduled 90-day automated key rotations, headless ephemeral CI/CD identity runners, pre-push secret scanning, and append-only compliance logs.</p>
        <span class="status-label">Phase 3</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .roadmap {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .roadmap::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--border-accent), transparent);
  }

  .roadmap-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-2xl) auto;
  }

  .baseline-banner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    background: rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-xl);
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-3xl) auto;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .baseline-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-success);
  }

  .baseline-desc {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .roadmap-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .roadmap-card {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    position: relative;
    transition: transform var(--transition-base), box-shadow var(--transition-base);
  }

  .roadmap-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 0 20px rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.05);
    border-color: rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.3);
  }

  .roadmap-icon {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.05);
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 196, 204, 0.2);
  }

  .roadmap-card h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .roadmap-card p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .status-label {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: var(--bg-tertiary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .roadmap-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
